{"seq":1,"slug":"srp-lcp-ttfb","title":"结果页 LCP/TTI 与首屏数据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/search-frontend-fullchain-performance/srp-page-perf/srp-lcp-ttfb","wordCount":2224,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"结果页-lcp-tti-与首屏数据\">结果页 LCP/TTI 与首屏数据</h1><p>讨论搜索结果页的 LCP 时,最常犯的错误是套用静态页的优化直觉:把 HTML 发早一点、把 CSS 内联一点、把首屏图片预加载一点。这些手段在静态页上有效,但在 SPA 架构的结果页上,它们对 LCP 的贡献接近于零——因为 LCP 的候选元素在结果数据到达之前根本不存在。理解这个差异是结果页首屏优化的起点:优化的对象不是&quot;HTML 到达得多早&quot;,而是&quot;数据到达后到第一排卡片画出来之间发生了什么&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-lcp-的候选元素何时出现\">核心概念:LCP 的候选元素何时出现</h2><p>Largest Contentful Paint 记录的是视口内最大内容元素的绘制时间。在静态页上,这个元素通常是一张 hero 图或一段标题,它们在 HTML 里就有,因此优化 HTML 的到达速度与资源优先级直接影响 LCP。在搜索结果页上,首屏最大元素大概率是第一排某张卡片的主图——而这张图来自结果数据接口的响应,HTML 里没有它。</p>\n<p>这带来一个关键结论:结果页的 LCP 满足如下近似关系。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{LCP} \\approx T_{data\\_ready} + T_{render} + T_{image\\_decode}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ima</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eco</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{data\\_ready}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是结果数据可用的时刻(含网络与服务端处理),<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{render}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是框架把卡片插入 DOM 并完成布局的时间,<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{image\\_decode}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ima</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eco</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是首屏候选图片下载与解码完成的时间。HTML 的到达时刻只通过影响 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{data\\_ready}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的起点间接起作用,如果数据请求是在一个庞大的 JS bundle 执行完之后才发出,那首屏慢的根因就在 bundle 而不在 HTML 的 TTFB。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>架构</th>\n<th>首屏 LCP 候选元素来源</th>\n<th>主要决定因素</th>\n<th>主要优化点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>纯 SPA</td>\n<td>数据请求后的渲染</td>\n<td>bundle 执行 + 数据往返 + 渲染</td>\n<td>首屏数据提前、bundle 精简、图片优先级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SSR</td>\n<td>HTML 内已有卡片</td>\n<td>HTML 到达 + 图片资源</td>\n<td>服务端渲染耗时、关键 CSS、图片预加载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流式 SSR</td>\n<td>HTML 分块到达</td>\n<td>首个结果分块的到达</td>\n<td>分块顺序、把结果块排在前面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边缘 SSR + 缓存</td>\n<td>缓存命中的 HTML</td>\n<td>边缘命中率</td>\n<td>缓存键设计、个性化参数剥离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户端预渲染</td>\n<td>预先渲染好的页面</td>\n<td>预测命中率</td>\n<td>见 <a href=\"../prefetch-cache/next-page-prefetch\">下一页/sug 预取</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表也是选择渲染架构的依据。注意流式 SSR 在搜索结果页上有一项天然优势:结果是有序的,可以先把前几条结果渲染出来随 HTML 发出,后续结果继续流式传输。用户看到的第一屏因此不依赖接口全部返回,只依赖前几条返回。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[用户提交搜索] --&gt; B[导航请求]&#10;    B --&gt; C{架构}&#10;    C --&gt;|SPA| D[下载并执行 JS bundle]&#10;    D --&gt; E[发起结果数据请求]&#10;    C --&gt;|SSR| F[服务端取数据 + 渲染 HTML]&#10;    F --&gt; G[HTML 到达]&#10;    C --&gt;|流式 SSR| H[HTML 头部先到]&#10;    H --&gt; I[首批结果分块到达]&#10;    I --&gt; J[首屏卡片插入 DOM]&#10;    E --&gt; K[数据到达]&#10;    K --&gt; J&#10;    G --&gt; J&#10;    J --&gt; L[首排主图请求]&#10;    L --&gt; M[图片解码完成]&#10;    M --&gt; N[LCP 记录]&#10;    J --&gt; O[hydration 完成 → TTI]&#10;    O --&gt; P[筛选/滚动可响应]\">graph TD\n    A[用户提交搜索] --&gt; B[导航请求]\n    B --&gt; C{架构}\n    C --&gt;|SPA| D[下载并执行 JS bundle]\n    D --&gt; E[发起结果数据请求]\n    C --&gt;|SSR| F[服务端取数据 + 渲染 HTML]\n    F --&gt; G[HTML 到达]\n    C --&gt;|流式 SSR| H[HTML 头部先到]\n    H --&gt; I[首批结果分块到达]\n    I --&gt; J[首屏卡片插入 DOM]\n    E --&gt; K[数据到达]\n    K --&gt; J\n    G --&gt; J\n    J --&gt; L[首排主图请求]\n    L --&gt; M[图片解码完成]\n    M --&gt; N[LCP 记录]\n    J --&gt; O[hydration 完成 → TTI]\n    O --&gt; P[筛选/滚动可响应]</pre><h2 id=\"首屏数据的分层-什么必须阻塞渲染\">首屏数据的分层:什么必须阻塞渲染</h2><p>如果结果页在一个请求里取回全部数据再渲染,那 LCP 被最后一个字段拖累。可行的做法是把数据分层:<strong>渲染所必需的字段</strong>必须最先可用,<strong>增强字段</strong>可以后补。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据层</th>\n<th>字段举例</th>\n<th>是否阻塞首屏</th>\n<th>到达时间要求</th>\n<th>失败处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>结构层</td>\n<td>结果条数、卡片类型序列、布局模式</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>与首个结果同时</td>\n<td>无法降级,必须重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容层</td>\n<td>卡片标题、价格、主图 URL、跳转链接</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>与结构层几乎同时</td>\n<td>缺失则该卡片不渲染</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增强层</td>\n<td>销量、评价数、促销标签、店铺认证</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>允许滞后数百毫秒</td>\n<td>占位留白或省略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>个性化层</td>\n<td>推荐理由、浏览历史标记</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>允许滞后</td>\n<td>省略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图片</td>\n<td>主图与角标的实际字节</td>\n<td>否(但影响 LCP)</td>\n<td>越早越好</td>\n<td>用占位图</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分层落地的方式有两种。第一种是接口层面拆两个端点:结构+内容接口(轻、快)与增强接口(可以慢),前端先渲染前者,后者到达后局部更新。第二种是同一个接口但服务端支持按字段裁剪,前端用两个请求分别取核心与增强字段。两种做法都要求前端具备&quot;局部更新而不整卡重渲染&quot;的能力,这正是记忆化要解决的问题,见 <a href=\"../card-render-perf/component-memoization\">卡片组件记忆化与无效重渲染</a>。</p>\n<p>分层有一个反作用需要防范:增强字段到达后如果改变了卡片高度,就会产生位移。因此增强字段占位的空间策略必须与骨架屏的设计一致,见 <a href=\"skeleton-perceived\">骨架屏/渐进渲染提升体感</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"图片优先级-把首屏候选图提前\">图片优先级:把首屏候选图提前</h2><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{image\\_decode}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ima</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eco</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在移动网络上是 LCP 的主要构成,而这部分可以主动干预。三个手段按收益排序:<strong>控制优先级提示</strong>、<strong>减小图片字节</strong>、<strong>提前发起请求</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;img&#10;  src=&quot;/p/img-320.webp&quot;&#10;  srcset=&quot;/p/img-320.webp 320w, /p/img-640.webp 640w&quot;&#10;  sizes=&quot;(max-width: 600px) 45vw, 220px&quot;&#10;  width=&quot;220&quot;&#10;  height=&quot;220&quot;&#10;  fetchpriority=&quot;high&quot;&#10;  decoding=&quot;async&quot;&#10;  alt=&quot;&quot;&#10;/&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">img</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  src</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/p/img-320.webp\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  srcset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/p/img-320.webp 320w, /p/img-640.webp 640w\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  sizes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"(max-width: 600px) 45vw, 220px\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  width</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"220\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  height</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"220\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  fetchpriority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"high\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  decoding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"async\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  alt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/></span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>fetchpriority=&quot;high&quot;</code> 提示浏览器调整这张图的网络调度优先级。它需要配合&quot;只有首屏前几张图才标 high&quot;使用——如果一屏 40 张图全标 high,等于没标,还会挤占关键脚本与样式。经验做法是只给首屏可视区内的前 2 到 4 张标 high,其余用 <code>loading=&quot;lazy&quot;</code> 并给第二个屏幕之后的内容加 <code>decoding=&quot;async&quot;</code>。</p>\n<p><code>srcset</code> 与 <code>sizes</code> 决定下载哪一档尺寸。搜索卡片的缩略图在移动端通常只需要 300 到 400 物理像素宽,如果服务端只提供原图或默认返回 800 像素档,单张图的字节数会高出数倍。图片格式上,AVIF 与 WebP 的压缩率明显优于 JPEG,现代浏览器支持率已经足够高,服务端按 <code>Accept</code> 头协商即可。</p>\n<p>提前发起请求指用 <code>preload</code> 或 <code>preconnect</code> 缩短建连与排队的延迟。搜索卡片图片的域名通常与主站不同(CDN 域名),一次 DNS + TLS 握手在移动网络上是几十到上百毫秒,<code>preconnect</code> 能把这段提前:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;link rel=&quot;preconnect&quot; href=&quot;https://img.example-cdn.com&quot; crossorigin /&gt;&#10;&lt;link rel=&quot;preload&quot; as=&quot;image&quot; href=&quot;/p/first-card.webp&quot; fetchpriority=&quot;high&quot; /&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">link</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"preconnect\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> href</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://img.example-cdn.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> crossorigin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">link</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"preload\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"image\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> href</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/p/first-card.webp\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchpriority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"high\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>preload</code> 首屏第一张图属于有条件的优化:它必须与实际使用的 URL 完全一致,否则会变成一次浪费的重复下载。如果首图 URL 依赖接口返回,那就无法在 HTML 里预加载,这种情况下退而求其次的做法是让骨架屏使用同一张图的低质量占位版本,先把网络连接与该图建立起关联。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tti-在结果页上的正确含义\">TTI 在结果页上的正确含义</h2><p>Time to Interactive 常被误读为&quot;页面加载完成&quot;。在搜索结果页上,它应该被理解为&quot;<strong>何时可用</strong>&quot;:用户的下一次操作(点筛选、翻页、滚动到下一屏)什么时候能得到响应。这个定义比&quot;加载完成&quot;有用得多,因为结果页几乎从不&quot;加载完成&quot;——用户可能在第一屏就操作,也可能滚动几屏之后才操作,而后者对首屏的 TTI 无感。</p>\n<p>把 TTI 落到可度量的量上,首屏可用性的判据是三条同时成立:首排卡片已绘制、事件处理器已绑定(hydration 完成或 SPA 已挂载)、主线程不再有超过 50 毫秒的连续长任务。第三条最容易被忽略:即使卡片画出来了,如果主线程正在处理一个 300 毫秒的任务,用户的点击仍然要等。</p>\n<p>主线程长任务的主要来源在结果页上有三类:hydration 或首次挂载的整树渲染、图片解码上传的聚集、以及首屏之后立即启动的预取和埋点上报。第三类是搜索页特有的——为了&quot;尽早开始收集曝光数据&quot;,不少实现在首屏渲染后立刻批量上报,如果上报走同步的序列化或加解密计算,会把首屏后的第一帧主线程占满。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 把非关键工作推到主线程空闲期&#10;const scheduleIdle = (work) =&gt;&#10;  &#39;requestIdleCallback&#39; in window ? requestIdleCallback(work, { timeout: 2000 }) : setTimeout(work, 200);&#10;&#10;scheduleIdle(() =&gt; {&#10;  reportImpressions(firstScreenItems);&#10;  warmNextPage();&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 把非关键工作推到主线程空闲期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> scheduleIdle</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">work</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'requestIdleCallback'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> window </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> requestIdleCallback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(work, { timeout: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> setTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(work, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">scheduleIdle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  reportImpressions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(firstScreenItems);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  warmNextPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对于 hydration 成本高的场景,按可见性分批 hydrate 是主流手段:首屏卡片立即 hydrate,首屏之外的卡片用 IntersectionObserver 在进入视口时才 hydrate。React 的 <code>useDeferredValue</code>、<code>startTransition</code> 与并发渲染能力可以把非紧急更新(如增强字段到达)降到后台,避免它们打断用户交互。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>结果页 LCP 候选元素来自数据而非 HTML,<code>$T_{LCP} \\approx T_{data\\_ready} + T_{render} + T_{image\\_decode}$</code>,优化对象是这三段。</li>\n<li>HTML 到达速度在 SPA 架构下对 LCP 的贡献有限,首屏慢若源于大 bundle,应从 bundle 下手。</li>\n<li>首屏数据分层:结构与内容层阻塞渲染,增强与个性化层允许滞后,前端需具备局部更新能力。</li>\n<li>图片优先级三手段:只给首屏前 2 到 4 张 <code>fetchpriority=&quot;high&quot;</code>、用 <code>srcset</code>/<code>sizes</code> 选对尺寸档、用 <code>preconnect</code> 提前建连。</li>\n<li>TTI 在结果页应理解为&quot;何时可用&quot;,判据是首排已绘制 + 事件已绑定 + 无持续长任务三者同时成立。</li>\n<li>首屏后的曝光上报与预取是搜索页特有的长任务来源,应推到空闲期执行。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"结果页 LCP/TTI 与首屏数据","id":"结果页-lcp-tti-与首屏数据"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念:LCP 的候选元素何时出现","id":"核心概念-lcp-的候选元素何时出现"},{"level":2,"text":"首屏数据的分层:什么必须阻塞渲染","id":"首屏数据的分层-什么必须阻塞渲染"},{"level":2,"text":"图片优先级:把首屏候选图提前","id":"图片优先级-把首屏候选图提前"},{"level":2,"text":"TTI 在结果页上的正确含义","id":"tti-在结果页上的正确含义"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"卡片组件记忆化与无效重渲染","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/search-frontend-fullchain-performance/card-render-perf/component-memoization"},"next":{"title":"骨架屏/渐进渲染提升体感","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/search-frontend-fullchain-performance/srp-page-perf/skeleton-perceived"}}